nding"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 422421, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Er5GNuJxDUoodkezDcQxnU", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to open_pr timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-half-even-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 422421, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Er5GNuJxDUoodkezDcQxnU", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 426209, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01TUyGJ141Srrn7d3trZNotC", "tool": "list_prs", "args": {"state": "open"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 426509, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01TUyGJ141Srrn7d3trZNotC", "tool": "list_prs", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 426509, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TUyGJ141Srrn7d3trZNotC", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 431464, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01CP2WrcX8zQSPFei5XvooaG", "tool": "request_review", "args": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"]}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 431764, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01CP2WrcX8zQSPFei5XvooaG", "tool": "request_review", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 431764, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01CP2WrcX8zQSPFei5XvooaG", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 437010, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug and opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer. CI passed on the fix.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` was rounding half-up (`ROUND_HALF_UP`), even though its own description says it uses banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`) per FIN-212. That's why `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` failed: 2.665 should round to 2.66 but came out as 2.68.\n- **Fix:** I switched it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on a new branch, `fix/money-half-even-rounding`.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** The request to open the PR timed out, so I checked the open PRs before trying again. The PR had been created, so I didn't open a second one. It had no reviewer on it, so I added alex.\n\nI couldn't look up FIN-212 because the advisory system doesn't recognise that ID. The fix just follows what the test and the code's own description say. The PR hasn't been merged: that needs a code owner's approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Aok94XJ1R1e5sECwpMG2r2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JFSsPUqvoeXuL82TCiZarB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01KsiegwmpCEyHoFx96NcuVV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01PwvAFQafL8J41mV7BPLVCr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Q5YgRJjbELaUvZ62KrbsTC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "message": "Use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) in round_money per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01BipycDPCwWUqsjNEEgxJyU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-money-half-even-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01WDNB8BQVyLwd1CqZfKF4vg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Er5GNuJxDUoodkezDcQxnU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Fix round_money to use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) per FIN-212", "body": "The nightly build was failing because `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` expects banker's rounding, but `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP` (despite its docstring saying ROUND_HALF_EVEN).\n\nChange: switch `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n\nCI: run ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-half-even-rounding"}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01TUyGJ141Srrn7d3trZNotC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"state": "open"}, "name": "list_prs", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The PR got created even though the request timed out, but there's no reviewer on it yet. I'll add alex.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01CP2WrcX8zQSPFei5XvooaG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"]}, "name": "request_review", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I fixed the rounding bug and opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer. CI passed on the fix.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` was rounding half-up (`ROUND_HALF_UP`), even though its own description says it uses banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`) per FIN-212. That's why `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` failed: 2.665 should round to 2.66 but came out as 2.68.\n- **Fix:** I switched it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on a new branch, `fix/money-half-even-rounding`.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** The request to open the PR timed out, so I checked the open PRs before trying again. The PR had been created, so I didn't open a second one. It had no reviewer on it, so I added alex.\n\nI couldn't look up FIN-212 because the advisory system doesn't recognise that ID. The fix just follows what the test and the code's own description say. The PR hasn't been merged: that needs a code owner's approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}